# The build context of Dockerfile.crm-web is the repository root: only the
# packages and the app go in, without what a local install or build left.
*
!packages/js
!apps/crm-web
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
apps/crm-web/screenshots
apps/crm-web/test-results
apps/crm-web/playwright-report
